## 11. Anti Patterns

### 11.1 Manual Infrastructure

Hand-configured servers. Not repeatable. Configuration drift. Not auditable.

### 11.2 Single Point of Failure

One database. One server. One region. No redundancy. High risk.

### 11.3 Over-Provisioning

Too much capacity. Wasted resources. Unnecessary costs. Right-size.

### 11.4 Flat Networks

No segmentation. All accessible. Security risk. Network isolation.

### 11.5 Cloud Anti Patterns

```yaml
# Không nên - single large instance
ec2:
  instance_type: xlarge.32xlarge
  # Everything on one machine!
```

```yaml
# Không nên - unlimited resources
s3:
  versioning: true
  replication: all-buckets
  # No lifecycle policies!
```

```yaml
# Không nên - open security
security_group:
  ingress:
    - protocol: all
      source: 0.0.0.0/0
```

